e", "call_id": "toolu_01BMdg5evG4NxeP1cz31rPub", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52834, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BMdg5evG4NxeP1cz31rPub", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54218, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017fRrfFJJV3tmK8e1im2C7s", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54518, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017fRrfFJJV3tmK8e1im2C7s", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54518, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017fRrfFJJV3tmK8e1im2C7s", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 58589, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and healthy again, and SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy. The release after it (v2.3.1-rc) and the current one (v2.3.1) were both unhealthy. The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, so I retried it once. The retry updated us-west and eu-west too.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. Health checks pass, and the error rate dropped from 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create it timed out, but checking the incident list showed it had been created. I didn't send it again, to avoid opening a duplicate and paging on-call twice.\n  - It describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial first attempt and the retry), and the current healthy state.\n  - It lists two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed (its release candidate was also unhealthy) and looking into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0128WPRUdygK7TM6j7QDbrQ8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019jiWugxKoPxWRXCkbgX4YS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0151eq5E8Gb85rERKEQC6RQe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UmFdj3UPh2uFqhaxqsA36a", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only reached us-east before stopping. Rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat, so I'll retry it once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Vr79gKc8L46pjRexKkzHhc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VCYPbi4rzuvHnwzP9RGHDy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YP9ZiZtqVpmaWFk2wP5yco", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type":